{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33758","headline":"正乐府十篇 贱贡士 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 贱贡士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南越贡珠玑，西蜀进罗绮。\n到京未晨旦，一一见天子。\n如何贤与俊，爲贡贱如此。\n所知不可求，敢望前席事。\n吾闻古圣人，射宫亲选士。\n不肖尽屏迹，贤能皆得位。\n所以谓得人，所以称多士。\n叹息几编书，时哉又何异。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}